  "details": "The libtiff packages contain a library of functions for manipulating Tagged Image File Format (TIFF) files.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * libtiff: libtiff: Heap-based buffer overflow via crafted PixarLog-compressed TIFF image (CVE-2026-12912)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
